/* 
 * Tomato FSP model
 * Adaptation of the FSPM_BASIC from Jochem Evers for tomato
 *
 * Notes:
 * without side shoots, they are considered removed
 * greenhouse construction and artificial lighting not included in this version
 *
 * Buttons:
 * press run - one simulation step (one day)
 * select Run, press run (1x) - run the model for the whole simulated period
 * press run2update - run the model from seed until the plant structure at transplant
 * press run2filePlantEval - run the model and save the model outputs at plant level in a file
 * press run2fileLeafLight - run the model and save the light-related outputs at leaf level in a file
 * 
 * Katarina Smolenova, WUR, 2022 - 2025
 */


